            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOur \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:07f42277-7d41-4d0b-b85a-a8ee6d067312}\u0022 type=\u0022media\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball England Brand Guidelines\u0022\u003Ebrand guidelines (PDF, 2.2MB)\u003C/a\u003E set out how to use our logo, our brand colours and our standards for typography and house style.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EColour logo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022\u0022 alt=\u0022Stoolball England colour logo\u0022 width=\u0022216\u0022 height=\u002289\u0022 data-udi=\u0022umb://media/72b6ec21a85e497bab227dc1b3849914\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:8a4eadef-77a2-49c2-93e7-47e69aa83c32}\u0022 type=\u0022media\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball England Colour Logo (EPS)\u0022\u003EEPS \u2013 colour logo (326K)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:edbe2261-5f54-4ea9-8c3a-e24dea017ce1}\u0022 type=\u0022media\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball England Colour Logo (PNG)\u0022\u003EPNG \u2013 colour logo (47K)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022\u0022 alt=\u0022Stoolball England colour logo with website address\u0022 width=\u0022216\u0022 height=\u0022103\u0022 data-udi=\u0022umb://media/0230262866e148d689048bea3e2ed635\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:89fd9352-e521-4cac-a594-1b184a0c46aa}\u0022 type=\u0022media\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball England Colour Logo with Website (EPS)\u0022\u003EEPS \u2013 colour logo with website address (421K)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:b36da7b1-15b5-414b-850a-9e54b0fbd3f7}\u0022 type=\u0022media\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball England Colour Logo with Website (PNG)\u0022\u003EPNG \u2013 colour logo with website address (61K)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003ESingle colour logo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022\u0022 a